<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_4__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The court may, during the pendency of investigations relating to the commission of an offence involving domestic violence, issue an interim protection order prohibiting the person against whom the order is made from using domestic violence against his or her spouse or former spouse or a child or an incapacitated adult or any other member of the family, as the case may be, as specified in the order."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/12/eng@> .
