<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the court is satisfied that the person against whom a protection order or interim protection order is made is likely to cause actual physical injury to the protected person or persons, the court may attach a power of arrest to such protection order or interim protection order, as the case may be."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_7__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/12/eng@> .
