<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who wilfully contravenes a protection order or any provision thereof shall be guilty of an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding two thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding six months or to both."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_8> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/12/eng@> .
