<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Any person who wilfully contravenes a protection order by using violence on a protected person shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding four thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding one year or to both."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_8> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/12/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/12/eng@> .
