<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/12/eng@/~part_II__cl_8__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "For the purposes of this section a \"protection order\" includes an interim protection order."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1994/12/eng@> .
